   - Use meeting_update_draft with the meeting_id from previous context
   - Extract: title="testing demo app", date="September 20"
   - Include: workspace_id="${this.workspaceId}", user_id="${session.userId}"
   - Call function with: {"meeting_id": "from_previous_context", "title": "testing demo app", "workspace_id": "...", "user_id": "..."}

